 471:common/prog/mem_utility/ring_buffer.c **** /** Closes a write operation
 472:common/prog/mem_utility/ring_buffer.c ****  *  \details If enabled nested writing to buffer is possible
 473:common/prog/mem_utility/ring_buffer.c ****  *  \param rb     pointer to ring buffer object
